Package: kiptv
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Xtream Codes IPTV player for KDE
 kiptv is a native KDE/Qt6 application for watching Xtream Codes IPTV
 live TV, movies and series, with libmpv-based playback.
 .
 It integrates with the KDE desktop: desktop notifications, multimedia
 keys, a system-tray icon, and persistent connection profiles.
